<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">LifeLink SL platform</div><h1 class="section-title">Practical features without a complicated interface.</h1><p class="section-sub">Each role sees only the tools needed for its work. Advanced clinical functions are intentionally outside the system.</p><div class="cards"><div class="card"><h3>Verified donor accounts</h3><p>Email and phone verification, password protection, MFA, availability, consent and notification preferences.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Emergency coordination</h3><p>Blood-group and district matching, donor Accept/Decline, live response totals, request expiry and staged escalation.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Hospital network</h3><p>Stage 3 referrals allow other approved hospitals to acknowledge and support unresolved emergency requests.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Inventory and transfers</h3><p>Prototype blood-unit records and traceable hospital-to-hospital transfer requests for demonstration purposes.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Campaign appointments</h3><p>Hospitals publish donation campaigns and donors reserve simple appointment times with attendance tracking.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Administration</h3><p>Hospital and user management, restricted organ-interest access, reports, security monitoring, settings, health checks and backups.</p></div></div></div></section>
